{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24059","headline":"和皇甫郎中秋晓同登天宫阁言怀六韵 · 白居易","name":"和皇甫郎中秋晓同登天宫阁言怀六韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧天忽已高，白日犹未短。\n玲珑晓楼阁，清脆秋丝管。\n张翰一桮酣，嵇康终日嬾。\n尘中足忧累，云外多疎散。\n病木斧斤遗，冥鸿羁緤断。\n逍遥二三子，永愿爲闲伴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24059.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24059","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}